  "description": "Life on spin cycle, or hung out to dry? \n\nSang-A's life becomes a living hell after meeting the mysterious Ya-Cheon, who places a curse on her. She quits her job and returns to her hometown where she discovers a dry cleaner run by Cheong-Myeong, to whom her destiny is tied. The two must unravel their red thread of fate and save Sang-A's soul. \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
